    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32752" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπρίασθαι</span></b> , aor. 2 (v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πρίαμαι</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buy off,</i>
			
